      "releaseNotes": "• Introducing Flip Chess! Reveal 32 randomly placed, face-down Chinese chess pieces. Take turns revealing, moving, or capturing as you plan your next move.\n• Discover unique capture rules: higher ranks capture lower ranks, pawns can capture generals, and equal-ranked opponents eliminate each other.\n• Play against AI or take turns with a friend on the same device, with undo and saved games.\n• Enjoy Flip Chess on iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch.",
